{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.58,
   "text": "And at the time, I was 24, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.78,
   "end": 6.92,
   "text": "And so I was just fresh into my new job and I had saved up as much as I could."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.4,
   "end": 11.32,
   "text": "And all the money that I had saved up was in the amount of about five grand."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.6,
   "end": 16.36,
   "text": "Because of this loan product, I was able to go in, buy a triplex for 190K."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.6,
   "end": 18.78,
   "text": "You can't do that today, at least not for that price."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.94,
   "end": 22.52,
   "text": "Those prices have increased, but that 3.5% down loan allowed me to do that."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.66,
   "end": 27.56,
   "text": "Not to mention, it also lowers the credit amount that you actually have to have."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.56,
   "end": 30.48,
   "text": "So your credit does not need to be perfect when you're using an FHA loan."
  }
 ],
